    "tree_id": "4ca3806ee3d7a672ca65c99db4e6d13e735ec24d",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:773] build the private test IPA 773: RPCS3 Core 947 on base 771, with the lots of IPA 772 declared again\n\nFrozen manifest build-utils/delivery/773.json, freeze commit 3a9acd75.\n\n- Base: verified IPA 771 (772 is not a base: its signed inventory was lost, recipe 3.8).\n- RPCS3: Core 947 (pin bb2a58d9) replaces 771's Core 945. It contains:\n  - the PPU suspension of waiting threads without acknowledgment;\n  - the PUT horizon for Black Ops II, deferring in the Atomic FIFO;\n  - the PPU short wait floor for God of War III;\n  - event waits in every thermal state;\n  - the God of War III loop sleep after an old savestate;\n  - the P/E cluster census.\n- S2Arm: engine 0001-0081 and bridge fixes, as in 772.\n- MeloNX: Core 9546deb7, the journal fix, and the session-end record, as in 772 plus fd3bdd8e.\n- Source-only:\n  - the Artemis cheat collections (1afde3fe), for 774;\n  - the MeloNX journal commits 8ee65d65 / 8b468239.\n\nChecked here: the delivery contract test, the offline contract, the freeze (no blocker, no unclassified\ncommit, no conflict, legal check passed), and the trigger paths (accepted).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-17T15:38:33Z",
